        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Madman's Return, \"Rhythm Is a Dancer\", \"Colour of Love\"\n- People: Snap!\n- Places: France, Ireland, Italy, the Netherlands, Germany, the United Kingdom, the United States\n\nFacts:\n- In December 1991, Snap! released \"Colour of Love\" as the first single from their second studio album, The Madman's Return.\n- The Madman's Return is Snap!'s second studio album.\n- \"Rhythm Is a Dancer\" is a song recorded by the German group Snap!.\n- The Madman's Return contains the international hit \"Rhythm Is a Dancer\".\n- \"Rhythm Is a Dancer\" reached No. 1 in France, Ireland, Italy, the Netherlands, Germany, and the United Kingdom.\n- \"Rhythm Is a Dancer\" peaked at No. 5 in the United States.",
